Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Changing two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Sheesh, more junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop dawdling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll also change two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Brother, \Nwant to double the bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have a full house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have \Na royal straight flush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! I lose {\i1}again{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, this time for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm out. This is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Brother? \NYou've done nothing but win for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you bored from only winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with the cards. \NThe problem is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.81,0:00:53.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It turns out that the \NPhilosopher's Stone was a fake,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we haven't produced \Nany other results, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.17,0:00:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be true...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:00:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just watch as I give my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Colonel Mustang \Nwe're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The kinds of sarcastic \Nthings he'll say to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:10.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just imagining it \Nputs me in a nasty mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is okay, Brother? \NGetting off the train along the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:31.60,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,You never know where information leading to the Philosopher's Stone might be lying around, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, Aquroya is a famous tourist spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't hurt to \Nhave a look at it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sort of feels like we're playing hooky from school, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's playing hooky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?! \NBrother, by any chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.85,0:03:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cheater! You cheated! Brother, you're a cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After her! Don't let her escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today's the day we catch Psiren!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, that's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got nowhere to run, Psiren!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty city, isn't it, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The City of Water, Aquroya, \Nis a famous sightseeing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is far better than going to that dusty East City,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and having to look into that \Ncynical face of the Colonel's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How the hell could you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} the City of Water, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Pops? Yow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're coming to \Nthe station with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something \NI want to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're a State Alchemist, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the famous Fullmetal one, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many times are you going to make me say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should be more \Nproof than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's the real thing, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How a pipsqueak like you could be—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:37.88,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,Who are you calling a pee-wee so small \Nthat you instinctively want to step on him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, nobody said anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, don't get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:45.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, we have an unidentified phantom thief in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who goes by the name of "Psiren" plaguing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Psiren?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We only have one thing \Nthat you could call a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's the fact that Psiren uses alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an alchemist too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I thought I would hear what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He kept repeating the same questions for three whole hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is he using for brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Brother, doesn't it bother you? I mean, an alchemist thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-My stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's some mild food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't just eat \Ntoo much, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better give you a shot. Clara-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! I hate shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Don't make a scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm okay! I'm already better!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not a child! \NHere, take off your coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, Al! Are you trying to \Nsell your brother out here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to make me mad, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:50.32,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Aah! I hate shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your shot is all done. \NThat didn't hurt, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I didn't even notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was incredibly fast work...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to grow up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She sure was a pretty nurse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I unexpectedly found myself fascinated by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of taste \Nhave you got, anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so good about \Na woman like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This won't do, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've left so much here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I just can't get them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help you there. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about I peel another piece of fruit for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That looks dangerous. I'll do it. \NLet me have it, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san isn't just pretty. \NShe's kind, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She kind of resembles Mom a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! \NThey're completely different!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, ma'am. \NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two are alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elric! Mr. Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now what, Pops?! \NI'm not a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We salute the State Alchemist, Edward Elric-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:12.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, I'm sorry about earlier. \NAs you said, Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I inquired of Commander Mustang of the Eastern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I did, it turned out that you really are a State Alchemist, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, I truly underestimated you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As it happens, Sensei,\N I have a favor to a—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As many as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With Sensei on our side, we can rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is the last day for Psiren.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, though, \Nthat's an awful lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't know \Nwhat Psiren is thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:54.78,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,sending prior notice to newspapers \Nthroughout the country of upcoming thefts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:10:00.09,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Newspaper reporters, spectators, \Nand even Psiren groupies show up as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's quite popular, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that popularity ends tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it in your hands, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:10.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'm going to go \Ncheck on the security situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Brother, \NI'm surprised you took on this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've taken an interest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in this alchemist thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are many ways \Nto use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:07.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I won't allow you \Nto use it for stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, thanks to you, \NI also got treated like a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now apologize, \Nfor all you're worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're a woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a shame I can't \Nshow you my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Children ought to be in \Nbed by now, pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who are you calling an ultra-hyper-pipsqueak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Al... Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he go, for crying out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise. Who would've thought that the kindly nurse
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is actually the Phantom Thief Psiren?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just came here to \Nget some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, medicine that you \Ntransmuted through alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lying bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't see how I'm a liar. \NI am an incredible beauty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, bad news...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think is the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's Psiren! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transmutation circle on her chest is more proof than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A lot can happen in one's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kids probably \Nwouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard earlier that the hospital is going to be demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:31.85,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Clara-san, you had no choice but to become a thief in order to save the hospital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, right, Clara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to become a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in order to save \Nthe patients here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're such a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! There's another notice from Psiren...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:04.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's less security around this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The owner of this mansion is a very cautious man, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a little trap \Nset up inside the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just watch, and you'll understand. \NThis time, Psiren has had it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the unexpected could always happen. If it does, we'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.81,0:15:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't particularly help {\i1}you{\i0} out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:13.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are times when \Nwrongdoing may be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes \Nto save the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that you sound like such a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} a grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. As a grown woman, \NI have to repay my debt to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you'd like me to do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're an alchemist, you must've \Nheard about the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have any information about it, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to get that stone, \Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:50.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you ever find out where the stone is, you let me know? I'll steal it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're able \Nto save the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure! Thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me she tricked us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! Clara-san would be \Nthe last person to do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There has to be \Nsome kind of mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only mistakes going on are inside that head of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Clara{\i0} has robbed \Nyour head of {\i1}clarity{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's terrible, Brother, \Nsaying it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't argue. \NIt goes against the will of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too bad about the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to save it, \Nbut I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so beside myself \Nwith grief that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,became a nun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who believe will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And there are still others \Nwhom I can save.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For example, this convent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will soon be demolished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right! This time, \Nyou've got to stick with it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll give you our support, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're saying that Psiren appeared again! \NThe whole city is in an uproar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's done it! \NNow the convent can be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you, an idiot?! Quit being such a nice guy already! She's a con artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just been teasing us \Nand having herself a laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say it like that, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't fight. \NStop it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! What are you this time, in that getup?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know! You've become a schoolteacher, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're fighting for a school \Nthat's soon to be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, right? \NIsn't that right, Clara-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, yes. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop jerking us around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you? \NAre you just a thief after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A common criminal, who uses alchemy for her own selfish interests?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think about it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another notice from Psiren!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you so pleased about? \NPsiren is just a common criminal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? We owe Psiren for saving the city of Aquroya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's our star of hope, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your star of hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.39,0:18:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This city—the City of Water, Aquroya—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sinks a little bit into \Nthe water every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In another five years, the whole city will be wiped out at the bottom of the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of that, \Neveryone else fled the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That made us all so lonesome. At least until Psiren appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:15.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But thanks to Psiren, \Nlife has returned to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reporters from all over the country \Nand tourists alike
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:20.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,come here in the hope of \Ncatching a glimpse of Psiren.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before disappearing under the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:26.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she has made Aquroya bloom one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does it mean, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Clara-san \Nbecame a thief to save the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe. The one thing \NI can say for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is that she tricked me—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's going to pay for that offense, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty fantastic, isn't it? \NA date here, on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear me, the same could be said of you, couldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want the Philosopher's Stone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The desire to have an object...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is the same in both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there is something that's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What we use our alchemy for, \Nand the burdens we each bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was pretty sharp, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll turn into a fine man. \NOnce you do, let's fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, as a man and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to the city of Xenotime and have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard that there's somebody there researching the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xenotime...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, are you still angry? \NI had no choice, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was, after all, \Na common criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was {\i1}not{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She wasn't just \Na common criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you said yourself that sometimes, wrongdoing is necessary, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clara-san was a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really think so too, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, it's a little bit warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could I get you to lower the zipper on my chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.90,0:23:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 11: "Land of Stones, Part 1"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.15,0:23:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And a red stone that binds the four of us together.
